/T (We are pleased to introduce the Geoeconomic Risk Barometer, the flagship research of the Geoeconomic Strategy Unit \(GSU\). The GSU is a research-driven initiative of analysts and strategists focused on making geopolitics and economics approachable in the boardroom. Our purpose is to help leaders make insightful, data-driven, and effective decisions in volatile markets across the world.)
/E (We are pleased to introduce the Geoeconomic Risk Barometer, the flagship research of the Geoeconomic Strategy Unit \(GSU\). The GSU is a research-driven initiative of analysts and strategists focused on making geopolitics and economics approachable in the boardroom. Our purpose is to help leaders make insightful, data-driven, and effective decisions in volatile markets across the world.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
