/E (The economic outlook remains uneven: commodity-exporting economies such as Chile will continue to benefit from high demand for copper and lithium. At the same time, elections in several major economies, such as Peru, Colombia, and Brazil, alongside the upcoming renegotiation of the US-Mexico-Canada Agreement \(USMCA\), may introduce policy uncertainty that could affect investment and trade flows over the coming year.)
