/P 1810 0 R
/T (As the war between Ukraine and Russia enters its fourth year, regional policy continues to prioritise defence spending, border security, and risk mitigation. In February, the European Commission announced its plans to fortify borders connected to Belarus, Ukraine, and Russia and to support investment in these regions through partnerships with the European Investment Bank and the World Bank, improving security conditions for economic activity. Defence and infrastructure companies could benefit from increased demand stemming from this investment.)
/E (As the war between Ukraine and Russia enters its fourth year, regional policy continues to prioritise defence spending, border security, and risk mitigation. In February, the European Commission announced its plans to fortify borders connected to Belarus, Ukraine, and Russia and to support investment in these regions through partnerships with the European Investment Bank and the World Bank, improving security conditions for economic activity. Defence and infrastructure companies could benefit from increased demand stemming from this investment.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2 1005 0 R 4]
>>
endobj
