/T (There has been no breakthrough in ceasefire negotiations, while Western governments and the EU remain committed to supplying military and financial assistance to Ukraine. This suggests that elevated security risk in the region is likely to persist, supporting continued demand for defence and infrastructure products and services. )
/E (There has been no breakthrough in ceasefire negotiations, while Western governments and the EU remain committed to supplying military and financial assistance to Ukraine. This suggests that elevated security risk in the region is likely to persist, supporting continued demand for defence and infrastructure products and services. )
